Growth verticals / optionality","body":"Exclusion server distribution (India-China trade normalization could unlock 5-10x revenue); AI product suite (15 products in pipeline, 7-8 launched); e-commerce portal for spare parts (future monetization); geographic expansion to 10 cities (Ahmedabad, Chennai, Kolkata, Noida) enabling local service delivery","src":"concall","as_of":"FY25"},"margins":{"title":"Margins & cost dynamics","body":"Hardware AMC: 25-30% EBITDA; Software/Products: 40-45% EBITDA; Influencer Marketing: 35-40% EBITDA; Exclusion Server: 10-15% EBITDA; overall PAT margin target 20% — low-margin Exclusion sales will pressure overall margin but boost top-line credibility for tenders","src":"concall","as_of":"FY25"},"capital_allocation":{"title":"Capital allocation","body":"Prioritizing inventory for AMC, expanding digital sales team (Hyderabad, Noida, Chennai), funding R&D for AI products, and maintaining liquidity for Exclusion server inventory. No dividend or buyback announced.","src":"concall","as_of":"FY25"},"management_tone":{"title":"Management quality / tone","body":"Confident, aggressive, and transparent — management openly acknowledges low-margin business for top-line growth, highlights strategic separation of digital arm, and sets bold FY26 targets with clear order book backing. Tone is entrepreneurial, not corporate.","src":"concall","as_of":"FY25"},"risks":{"title":"Risks & watch-items","body":"Customer concentration risk (top 5 clients ~25-30% revenue); receivables rising to 6.5 Cr (110+ days); Exclusion server revenue delayed due to India-China trade tensions; margin compression from low-margin hardware sales; execution risk in scaling 10x enterprise digital business","src":"concall","as_of":"FY25"},"non_obvious":{"title":"Non-obvious takeaways","body":"The 45 Cr order is not just a project — it’s a template for bundled telecom contracts (software + hardware + 10-year AMC + managed services) that Olatech can replicate; influencer marketing is not just a service but a productized platform with IP (Earnin.me) and regional sales teams; Exclusion server distribution is a hidden lever — if India-China trade eases, this could become a 50 Cr+ business with minimal capex","src":"concall","as_of":"FY25"},"challenges":{"title":"Challenges → beneficiaries & losers","body":"| Challenge | Beneficiary/Loser | Dir | Conviction | Note |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| — | — | — | — | — |","src":"concall","as_of":"FY25"}}}